    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\nBOGGANFIN, BALLYMURRAY, CO. ROSCOMMON\r\nPRIME C.1.26 ACRE SITE\r\n\r\n€75,000\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this prime c.1.26 acre site situated in the highly sought-after Ballymurray area, just minutes from Roscommon Town.\r\n\r\nThe property previously benefited from planning permission and occupies an excellent countryside setting on a quiet cul-de-sac road, while remaining close to all amenities and services.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for those wishing to construct a family home in a mature residential location with easy access to Roscommon Town, Athlone and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n• Prime c.1.26 Acre Site \r\n• Previously Granted Planning Permission \r\n• Quiet Cul-de-Sac Location \r\n• Just Off the Main N61 Roscommon–Athlone Road \r\n• Excellent Residential Area \r\n• Easy Access to Roscommon Town \r\n• Attractive Level Site \r\n• Sought-After Ballymurray Location\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n• 5 Minutes Drive to Roscommon Town Centre \r\n• 2 Minutes Drive to Ballymurray National School \r\n• 3 Minutes Drive to Knockcroghery Village \r\n• Easy Access to Athlone and the M6 Motorway\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €75,000\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers MIPAV MMCEPI PSRA Licence No. 002031\r\nRoscommon & Mayo Offices\r\n086 2130723 094 9362216\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: These particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details provided."
      },
